EVTDESC54;You're playing with Project Alice or Katerina's Engine, while we are trying our best to support it, expect bugs and weird behavior. The neutrality system is currently not supported in any of the engines, and the dynamic tooltips will be glitched in Alice. \n\n Our personal recommendation is to adjust your settings to: \n\n Graphics Settings/Map Projection: Equirectang \n Map Lettering: None \n AntiAliasing: 8 \n Gaussian Blur: 0.25 \n Misc Settings/Spoilers: Off \n\n But feel free to do as you please.;;;;;;;;;;;;;x
